Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.27,0:00:03.35,Flashback,Masamune,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.35,0:00:08.82,Flashback,Aki,0,0,0,,I think it's okay for at least one person to \Npick up what you're trying to throw away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.77,0:00:11.03,Flashback,Aki,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.26,0:00:16.49,Flashback,Aki,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Makabe Masamune-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.08,0:01:53.05,Episode Title,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1475,1050)\fsp2}#11 "{\c&H388CE9&}F{\c}a{\c&H388CE9&}c{\c}e {\c&H388CE9&}Y{\c}o{\c&H388CE9&}u{\c}r {\c&H388CE9&}F{\c}e{\c&H388CE9&}e{\c}l{\c&H388CE9&}i{\c}n{\c&H388CE9&}g{\c}s"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.99,0:01:48.81,Main Top,Teacher,0,0,0,,Hoshino.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.81,0:01:49.54,Main Top,Hoshino,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.13,0:01:50.96,Main Top,Teacher,0,0,0,,Honjou.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.96,0:01:51.91,Main Top,Honjou,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.34,0:01:53.23,Main Top,Teacher,0,0,0,,Makabe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.94,0:01:58.13,Main,Teacher,0,0,0,,Makabe's absent again?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.75,0:02:00.53,Main,Teacher,0,0,0,,Next, Mishima.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.53,0:02:01.45,Main,Mishima,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.45,0:02:02.10,Main,Teacher,0,0,0,,Mutou.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.10,0:02:03.01,Main,Mutou,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.62,0:02:04.53,Main,Teacher,0,0,0,,Yaguchi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.93,0:02:10.02,Main,Tae,0,0,0,,Man, Masamune-kun's still absent.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.34,0:02:12.13,Main,Kojuurou,0,0,0,,Is this three days now?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.13,0:02:13.93,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,Today is the fourth day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.93,0:02:16.61,Main,Kojuurou,0,0,0,,Spring break might start \Nbefore he comes back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.89,0:02:21.89,Main,Tae,0,0,0,,Fujinomiya-san, do you know anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.89,0:02:25.70,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,No... I'm terribly sorry, but I do not.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.70,0:02:29.20,Main,Kojuurou,0,0,0,,I've sent him messages, \Nbut he hasn't responded.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.20,0:02:31.37,Main,Tae,0,0,0,,He's been ignoring you, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.37,0:02:33.88,Main,Tae,0,0,0,,Is he so sick that he \Ncan't even get out of bed?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.88,0:02:35.65,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,If his condition was that grave,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.65,0:02:39.24,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,I don't think our teacher would be \Ncalling his name every morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.24,0:02:40.63,Main,Tae,0,0,0,,True.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.63,0:02:44.21,Main,Kojuurou,0,0,0,,Being absent without permission\Nfor three or four days won't
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.21,0:02:45.58,Main,Kojuurou,0,0,0,,damage his record, will it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.58,0:02:47.93,Main,Tae,0,0,0,,I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.55,0:02:50.94,Main,Kojuurou,0,0,0,,Oh, it's Adagaki-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.50,0:02:53.93,Main,Tae,0,0,0,,Adagaki-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.27,0:02:56.51,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Futaba-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.10,0:02:59.51,Main,Tae,0,0,0,,Thank goodness. Perfect timing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.36,0:03:04.16,Main,Tae,0,0,0,,Hey, does Masamune-kun have, \Nlike, a cold or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.16,0:03:05.30,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,A cold?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.30,0:03:11.34,Main,Tae,0,0,0,,I mean, he's been absent for four days,\Nand he hasn't contacted any of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.34,0:03:14.59,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Well, that sounds awful. \NI hope he's doing all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.59,0:03:17.90,Main,Tae,0,0,0,,Wait... Did you not know?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.90,0:03:20.02,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,I did not. This is the first I've heard of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.02,0:03:22.55,Main,Tae,0,0,0,,Huh?! B-But you two are dating, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.49,0:03:26.31,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,No, we've broken up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.79,0:03:37.10,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,What do you mean, Aki-sama?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.10,0:03:40.65,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Exactly what it sounds like. \NI broke up with Makabe.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.65,0:03:43.11,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,No... But you can't do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.53,0:03:45.57,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,You can't, Aki-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.57,0:03:50.30,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,I don't remember you getting \Nto decide that for me, Yoshino.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.69,0:03:55.79,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Anyway, it's over now. \NThere's no point in discussing it further.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.27,0:04:06.63,Main,Tae,0,0,0,,You didn't know about those two, \Neither, Koiwai-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.23,0:04:11.59,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Not only did I not know... \NThis is all a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.99,0:04:13.06,Main,Tae,0,0,0,,A mistake?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.37,0:04:17.48,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,After school, I'm going to Pig's Foot's— \Nto Makabe-kun's house.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.48,0:04:19.92,Main,Tae,0,0,0,,To visit him? Then I'll go, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.92,0:04:21.28,Main,Kojuurou,0,0,0,,M-Me, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.69,0:04:23.41,Main,Kojuurou,0,0,0,,What about you, Fujinomiya-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.17,0:04:26.74,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,I'll also go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.74,0:04:30.32,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I think someone triggered \Nsomething they shouldn't have.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.32,0:04:32.45,Main,Tae,0,0,0,,Um... Koiwai-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.45,0:04:35.71,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,But if I can find out the reason, \NI'll know how to follow through.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.89,0:04:40.13,Main,Tae,0,0,0,,Huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.53,0:04:43.72,Main,Tae,0,0,0,,So this is what Masamune-kun's \Nhouse looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.72,0:04:46.09,Main,Kojuurou,0,0,0,,I-It's pretty nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.50,0:04:50.97,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,I believe that Koiwai-san \Nand myself have visited before.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.97,0:04:52.74,Main,Kojuurou,0,0,0,,What? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.74,0:04:55.09,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,It was incredibly awkward.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.09,0:04:56.56,Main,Tae,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.95,0:04:58.98,Main,Tae,0,0,0,,I guess now's not the time for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.38,0:05:06.62,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Is no one home?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.62,0:05:09.49,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,Now that you mention it, \NI don't see any lights on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.49,0:05:10.86,Main,Tae,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.86,0:05:13.18,Main,Kojuurou,0,0,0,,What should we do with these puddings?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.18,0:05:15.46,Main,Kojuurou,0,0,0,,They're super fluffy ones, \Nmade with eggs from the highlands.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.46,0:05:17.92,Italics,Chinatsu,0,0,0,,Pudding?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.65,0:05:19.90,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Chinatsu-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.38,0:05:29.31,Main,Chinatsu,0,0,0,,I smell pudding!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.05,0:05:39.81,Main,Chinatsu,0,0,0,,Yeah... Humans definitely \Ncan't live on just school meals.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.81,0:05:42.97,Main,Chinatsu,0,0,0,,Thanks for the treat. \NThey were super delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.97,0:05:47.12,Main,Kojuurou,0,0,0,,W-Were they? They're puddings from \Na pâtisserie that's all the rage right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.12,0:05:49.31,Main,Chinatsu,0,0,0,,Are you my brother's friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.71,0:05:52.81,Main,Chinatsu,0,0,0,,Yet you're this keen on sweets?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.46,0:05:55.27,Main,Kojuurou,0,0,0,,Th-Thanks?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.73,0:06:03.16,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,Pardon my asking, but has \Nsomething happened at home?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.16,0:06:07.95,Main,Chinatsu,0,0,0,,Well, my mom's been sorta, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.66,0:06:15.77,Main,Tae,0,0,0,,What's in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.77,0:06:17.34,Main,Chinatsu,0,0,0,,My brother's room.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.86,0:06:24.98,Main,Chinatsu,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry. I've been a bit busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.62,0:06:29.03,Main,Chinatsu,0,0,0,,Mom? I'm coming in.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.61,0:06:36.45,Main,Tae,0,0,0,,Whoa. All this stuff to get swole.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.45,0:06:38.91,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,I guess that's not surprising \Ncoming from Masamune-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.97,0:06:44.61,Main,Chinatsu,0,0,0,,Mom, Onii-chan's friends are here to visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.01,0:06:49.34,Main,Kinue,0,0,0,,Maa-kun? Is that you, Maa-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.74,0:06:53.05,Main,Chinatsu,0,0,0,,No, they're Onii-chan's friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.05,0:06:55.17,Main,Chinatsu,0,0,0,,They brought pudding, too. Do you want some?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.55,0:06:58.46,Main,Kinue,0,0,0,,No... Maa-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.46,0:07:02.52,Main,Kinue,0,0,0,,Why did you disappear, Maa-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.52,0:07:03.42,Main,Kinue,0,0,0,,Gyof.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.47,0:07:07.82,Main,Kinue,0,0,0,,Waaah! Maa-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.82,0:07:10.26,Main,Kinue,0,0,0,,Why did you leave me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.90,0:07:11.65,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Leave? What does she mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.65,0:07:17.07,Main,Chinatsu,0,0,0,,My brother ended up going to our grandpa's \Nplace in Shinshu, and he took all his stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.45,0:07:18.54,Main,Tae and Kojuurou,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.54,0:07:20.18,Main,Kojuurou,0,0,0,,Shinshu?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.72,0:07:22.29,Main,Tae,0,0,0,,I guess it wasn't a cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.97,0:07:26.02,Main,Chinatsu,0,0,0,,He went out last weekend,\Nand when he came back,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.02,0:07:28.32,Main,Chinatsu,0,0,0,,he suddenly wouldn't listen to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.32,0:07:32.70,Main,Kinue,0,0,0,,But I tried! I tried to stop him!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.70,0:07:34.01,Main,Chinatsu,0,0,0,,Yes, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.52,0:07:35.65,Main,Chinatsu,0,0,0,,As you can see,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.65,0:07:39.69,Main,Chinatsu,0,0,0,,Mom's not functioning as a person anymore,\Nand the chores are just piling up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.69,0:07:41.54,Main,Chinatsu,0,0,0,,I have no idea what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.19,0:07:43.73,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Last weekend...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.16,0:07:45.44,Main,Tae,0,0,0,,Any ideas?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.44,0:07:48.28,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,He went on a date with Aki-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.28,0:07:50.41,Main,Tae,0,0,0,,Do you think something happened then?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.92,0:07:52.96,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,That sounds quite likely.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.96,0:07:56.80,Main,Tae,0,0,0,,Maybe Adagaki-san gave him a \Nreally mean nickname or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.80,0:07:58.66,Main,Kojuurou,0,0,0,,And he decided to run away?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.67,0:08:03.62,Main,Chinatsu,0,0,0,,We have no way of getting \Nthrough to my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.17,0:08:08.80,Main,Chinatsu,0,0,0,,Whether he comes or goes, \Nhe won't listen to what we have to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.21,0:08:12.81,Main,Chinatsu,0,0,0,,Even though he has all these people \Nworrying about him now...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.31,0:08:17.15,Main,Chinatsu,0,0,0,,My brother really is an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.56,0:08:20.93,Main,Chinatsu,0,0,0,,I'm sorry about this, \Nafter you came to visit...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.93,0:08:23.84,Main,Tae,0,0,0,,No, no. I'm sorry we dropped by out of the blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.84,0:08:27.34,Main,Chinatsu,0,0,0,,It's fine. I think my mom \Nregained some of her sanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.40,0:08:33.21,Main,Chinatsu,0,0,0,,We can't get a hold of him, \Nbut if we hear anything, we'll contact you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.21,0:08:34.36,Main,Tae,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.36,0:08:36.22,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,We look forward to hearing from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.33,0:08:41.50,Main,Tae,0,0,0,,Well, that didn't really get us anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.94,0:08:47.30,Main,Kojuurou,0,0,0,,But at least we know where he is now, \Neven if all we can do is wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.70,0:08:50.34,Main,Kojuurou,0,0,0,,I think waiting for him is important, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.60,0:08:52.67,Main,Tae,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.25,0:08:55.25,Main,Kojuurou,0,0,0,,I'll see you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.99,0:09:04.89,Main,Tae,0,0,0,,Wait for him, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.89,0:09:06.62,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.62,0:09:10.38,Main,Tae,0,0,0,,But, man... Shinshu? That's so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.38,0:09:13.62,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,It certainly doesn't change \Nthe fact that we're worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.47,0:09:16.74,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,What do you mean by that, exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.27,0:09:19.26,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,What are {\i1}you{\i0} worried about?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.26,0:09:20.99,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,You're actually happy, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.99,0:09:22.30,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,Koiwai-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.19,0:09:26.23,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,This is all your fault to begin with.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.92,0:09:30.62,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,You got into Aki-sama's head, and now \Nyou got exactly what you wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.62,0:09:31.30,Main,Tae,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.30,0:09:33.72,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,You went out of your way to \Ndo something so underhanded...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.72,0:09:37.65,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Even though Pig's Foot is never \Ngoing to look your way anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.21,0:09:47.45,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,In that case, wouldn't you say what \Nyou've been doing is also rather deceitful?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.45,0:09:48.35,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Deceitful?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.35,0:09:52.80,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,You've known where Masamune-sama's \Nfeelings lay for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.80,0:09:55.44,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,And yet, you ignored them \Nand sent Aki-sama after him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.44,0:09:58.93,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,Just to protect yourself, \Nyou lied about your own feelings!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.93,0:10:00.99,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,My feelings don't matter here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.99,0:10:03.17,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,If this ain't deceit, then what is it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.17,0:10:05.06,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,You're the biggest coward here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.06,0:10:08.71,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,Who cares about your past \Nor Adagaki-san's past?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.62,0:10:14.17,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,I have nothing! I have absolutely nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.23,0:10:20.41,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.83,0:10:25.79,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Stop fighting out here. \NYou'll bother the neighbors.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.53,0:10:31.05,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Futaba-san, I'm sorry, but could \Nyou walk Fujinomiya-san home?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.05,0:10:32.15,Main,Tae,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.21,0:10:53.71,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Let's have a chat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.46,0:10:57.41,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Just the two of us. One on one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.06,0:11:15.48,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,I think that should do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.69,0:11:22.95,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Oh, look at those flames go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.30,0:11:28.25,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,It's not like staring at a bonfire \Nis gonna give me any answers...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.25,0:11:31.35,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,But I really don't want to think \Nabout anything right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.17,0:11:36.78,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,I came here when I felt like this as a kid, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.77,0:11:42.56,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,But this time, I have no one to hate.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.56,0:11:43.79,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,So why...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.09,0:11:46.33,Main,Grandpa,0,0,0,,Masamune.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.86,0:11:49.07,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Grandfather.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.67,0:11:52.31,Main,Grandpa,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.85,0:11:56.93,Main,Grandpa,0,0,0,,You're not allowed to bring \Nsnacks into this household.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.50,0:12:02.07,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,I'm terribly sorry. I wasn't thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.47,0:12:15.91,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,I guess burning them doesn't even \Ncreate a sweet scent or anything...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.58,0:12:33.64,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Thinking back on everything, I don't think \Nwe've ever had a proper conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.27,0:12:38.50,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Not putting aside that I'm the daughter of \Nthe Adagaki family, and you're the daughter
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.50,0:12:40.11,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,of the Koiwai family who serves us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.02,0:12:45.57,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Can we actually put aside \Nstatus and talk, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.99,0:12:50.89,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,I think I thought the same thing, which is \Nwhy I never properly acknowledged you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.61,0:12:54.18,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Even though you've been \Nright by my side this whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.22,0:12:57.90,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,We've done so much together.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.39,0:12:59.50,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,We have.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.93,0:13:01.96,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,And you've done a lot for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.96,0:13:03.27,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I have...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.41,0:13:05.68,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,A lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.29,0:13:16.03,Italics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I wonder what kind of memories \NAki-sama is remembering.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.26,0:13:19.53,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,But this is my job.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.96,0:13:23.61,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,It's because I've always relied on you so much
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.61,0:13:27.06,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,that your only choice was to \Nkill off your own feelings...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.55,0:13:29.70,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Even though you like Makabe.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.90,0:13:37.08,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,You couldn't say that even if you wanted to.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.82,0:13:42.05,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,N-No... No, no, no, you're wro—
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.37,0:13:46.05,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Yoshino.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.46,0:13:47.98,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Aki-sama...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.98,0:13:50.85,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,It must've been really hard this whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.19,0:13:55.43,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Do you like him?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.91,0:14:03.77,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I just want you to be happy, Aki-sama...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.65,0:14:07.32,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Well, that's something for me to decide.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.32,0:14:09.79,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,You don't need to worry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.27,0:14:13.67,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,But this is what I decided deep down.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.98,0:14:17.78,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I did something awful that \Ncould never be forgiven, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.78,0:14:20.08,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I need to make up for it, at least a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.61,0:14:24.30,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,But when I spent more time with him...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.84,0:14:24.80,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(338.667,52.667)\an8\fs12\shad0\b1\c&HC2CCB5&\bord0\frz347.6\frx4\fry0}Contacts
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.84,0:14:24.80,Main,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs12\shad0\b1\c&H9FBCC4&\bord0\frz347.6\frx4\fry0\pos(367.333,70)}Pig's Foot
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.37,0:14:26.76,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.09,0:14:33.86,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Aki-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.86,0:14:38.39,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,I understand how you feel. \NSo don't apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.99,0:14:44.14,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,This will be the last time \NI request something from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.70,0:14:47.45,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,I want you to properly face your own feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.18,0:14:52.57,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Go. Tell him how you feel yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.53,0:15:00.54,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Okay, Aki-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.47,0:15:09.30,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,The next time we see each other, \Nyou can just call me "Aki"!
