Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.74,0:15:38.25,Main,Tae,0,0,0,,You set a new record!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.25,0:15:39.65,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,I'm honored.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.13,0:15:42.71,Main,Tae,0,0,0,,Now, let's order more drinks!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.46,0:15:47.27,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,Futaba-san, thank you for being so considerate.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.27,0:15:49.30,Main,Tae,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.07,0:15:54.01,Main,Tae,0,0,0,,The only ways to heal a broken heart \Nare overeating and karaoke!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.01,0:15:55.85,Main,Tae,0,0,0,,That's common knowledge for girls!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.45,0:15:57.51,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,Common knowledge...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.19,0:16:01.45,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,Well, I do think I feel a little better.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.45,0:16:04.96,Main,Tae,0,0,0,,You know, it wouldn't hurt to \Nlook around you a bit more.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.96,0:16:06.83,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.71,0:16:10.07,Main,Tae,0,0,0,,For example, other classmates...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.48,0:16:12.24,Main,Tae,0,0,0,,Like, what about Kojuurou-kyun?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.53,0:16:18.08,Main,Tae,0,0,0,,Masamune x Kojuurou,\Na.k.a. MasaKoju, is my ship,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.08,0:16:21.06,Main,Tae,0,0,0,,but I wouldn't mind sharing him with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.67,0:16:24.46,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,I can't say I feel anything right now...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.46,0:16:27.78,Main,Tae,0,0,0,,I see. I mean, I guess you did love him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.43,0:16:31.22,Main,Tae,0,0,0,,Say, Fujinomiya-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.22,0:16:34.93,Main,Tae,0,0,0,,If you truly fall in love, there's something \Nthat will always remain with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.41,0:16:37.43,Main,Tae,0,0,0,,No girl is truly empty inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.75,0:16:42.39,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,Thank you very much, Futaba-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.97,0:16:46.86,Main,Tae,0,0,0,,Okay! We should sing this next song together!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.86,0:16:49.69,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,Oh, then maybe we should \Nsing the {\i1}Hada Pure{\i0} song.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.69,0:16:51.17,Main,Tae,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.61,0:16:55.61,Main,Tae,0,0,0,,Let's see... Okay, sent!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.78,0:16:58.46,Main,Tae,0,0,0,,H-Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.46,0:16:59.33,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,That's not it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.33,0:17:00.58,Main,Tae,0,0,0,,What song is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.49,0:17:12.21,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Hey... Let me through.
