Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.30,0:17:52.59,Italics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I'm such a shameless liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.91,0:17:57.62,Flashback,Girl A,0,0,0,,Look at him!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.62,0:18:00.66,Flashback,Girl B,0,0,0,,Isn't Makabe Masamune-kun handsome?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.80,0:18:07.27,Italics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,When we reunited in high school, \NI felt like my breathing might stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.65,0:18:10.32,Italics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I decided to see how things \Nwould go before setting a trap,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.32,0:18:12.19,Italics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,and the hot guy easily fell for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.06,0:18:14.65,Italics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,He's such a simpleton.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.35,0:18:18.36,Flashback,Masamune,0,0,0,,I still have no regrets about \Ntrying to give that woman
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.36,0:18:20.63,Flashback,Masamune,0,0,0,,a taste of her own medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.63,0:18:22.49,Italics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,And so stubborn at the most awkward times.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.51,0:18:26.21,Flashback,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Don't get caught up in her pace.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.21,0:18:27.76,Flashback,Masamune,0,0,0,,That's not happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.38,0:18:30.88,Italics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,He doesn't make any sense and he's oblivious.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.77,0:18:33.84,Italics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.77,0:18:38.23,Italics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I never thought my heart would hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.15,0:18:41.73,Italics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I tried to pretend I didn't notice it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.73,0:18:43.21,Italics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I thought I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.89,0:18:45.01,Italics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.01,0:18:49.94,Flashback,Masamune,0,0,0,,I think I had the most fun when \NI was devising my plan with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.49,0:18:51.98,Italics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,There was no way I could tell him...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.22,0:18:55.37,Italics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,that I had fun, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.65,0:19:01.55,Italics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Even so, Aki-sama told me to move forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.29,0:19:12.65,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I'm getting off. Please let me through.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.83,0:19:16.80,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Man, this fog is dense.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.49,0:19:20.39,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,I guess I'll clean up the firewood.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.73,0:19:42.46,Main,Little Masamune,0,0,0,,Gwandfather... I can't run anymo—
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.29,0:19:45.37,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.77,0:19:52.13,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Hey, Little Me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.13,0:19:53.42,Main,Little Masamune,0,0,0,,Hey, Big Me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.42,0:19:56.62,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Diet and exercise are pretty rough, huh? \NWhy not run away?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.62,0:19:59.14,Main,Little Masamune,0,0,0,,N-No! I can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.14,0:20:00.10,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Why's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.17,0:20:02.76,Main,Little Masamune,0,0,0,,Because I'm gonna get revenge!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.66,0:20:08.30,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Revenge, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.30,0:20:10.56,Main,Little Masamune,0,0,0,,That's right! Revenge!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.56,0:20:13.21,Main,Little Masamune,0,0,0,,I'm gonna get my revenge and make her pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.21,0:20:14.85,Main,Little Masamune,0,0,0,,That's why I won't run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.50,0:20:19.28,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Listen, Little Me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.17,0:20:22.22,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,She's not your enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.83,0:20:24.60,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,The enemy's already been defeated.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.60,0:20:25.27,Main,Little Masamune,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.77,0:20:28.01,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,I'm sure that just sounds like \Nsome pleasantries...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.43,0:20:32.73,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,But right now, there are no enemies \Nin front of me. Not a single one.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.66,0:20:36.29,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,So... you don't have to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.33,0:20:40.14,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,All your hard work won't go to waste, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.66,0:20:43.30,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,It might not be exactly how you imagined it...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.61,0:20:47.85,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,But you and I will be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.22,0:20:53.58,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,Because we just had the \Nwrong idea about something.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.90,0:20:56.29,Main,Little Masamune,0,0,0,,Huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.41,0:21:02.25,Main,Little Masamune,0,0,0,,This feels weird, but bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.25,0:21:03.87,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Yeah, see you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.62,0:21:27.99,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Well, guess I'll go for my morning run.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.87,0:21:32.89,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,What is that? A tanuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.26,0:21:36.81,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Mas...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.08,0:21:41.35,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Master?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.41,0:21:45.19,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Pig's... Foot...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.25,0:22:00.45,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Ow...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.11,0:22:03.94,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Mas—
